W5-M12 machine-readable capability and pricing description.

This package owns the selected-offer description, CLI, loopback offer HTTP,
and actual-interface regressions only. It does not copy
server/paid-useful-jobs (SDS52 / W5-D01) or invent a second job engine.

It reads the PR52 catalog, pins, and wrapper CLI as the current runtime.
W5-M01 selected-catalog and W5-D26 cost-floor files are consumed when present
and recorded as unbound when absent.

